    given-names: Lauren Victoria
  - family-names: Smith
    given-names: Tommy
version: 2.7.215
date-released: 2026-07-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/openlunar/overlap"
url: "https://github.com/openlunar/overlap"
abstract: >
  A browser-based governance simulation of the lunar south pole. Two coalition
  programs compete and cooperate over water ice under Designated Lunar Area
  safety-zone regimes, on terrain derived from LRO data products. Includes a
  deterministic Monte Carlo research pipeline with paired-seed analysis.
